{"3954850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prescribe and Pray", "steam_appid": 3954850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/27035618087216b85388b73bbf7460e8.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=699 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Congratulations.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without qualifications, without a degree, and without the slightest credibility, the <strong><i>Last Breath Clinic</i></strong> entrusts you with the position of <i>general practitioner</i> within its hospital factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome patients, examine them, diagnose, and prescribe with caution. A mistake can happen so quickly…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any questions, complaints, or special requests, please refer to our motto:<br><strong><i>“Health has a price, and everyone must contribute.”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/9f1aecb712dad0feccb60b6d597065b0.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>Every patient is a potential fraudster. You have been warned.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fake name, expired card, invalid insurance? It’s up to you to keep undesirables from accessing healthcare. You are the last line of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Management is watching you…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/010866f20fd242111a7c404a2ffcdb64.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Put away your rudimentary tools: medicine is serious business.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, Management equips you with the finest French medical technology. True diagnostic weapons, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a rechargeable battery-powered flashlight</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a thermometer that goes beep-beep</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>an intra-auricular blood pressure monitor</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a suspicious-odor sniffer</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/fc94eeb0622d1debac4a849c76b65543.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stranger-than-strange diseases…</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visceral sensitivity to light (vomiting included), sudden appearance of a wagging tail, or instant hair regrowth… Here, every symptom is a surprise, every diagnosis a gamble, and every mistake leaves a mark—on your paycheck as well as in tomorrow’s news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/0a6e43866db3ce7f4b0b652f6f4748fe.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1560 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/2529bef0619bfaa40ec0204edccca217.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Schemes, lies, bribes, and retaliation.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, being a doctor is not limited to treating patients. Every decision matters. Some choices make survival easier. Others bring it to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this world, a single mistake can cost more than your reputation.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/27035618087216b85388b73bbf7460e8.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=699 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Congratulations.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without qualifications, without a degree, and without the slightest credibility, the <strong><i>Last Breath Clinic</i></strong> entrusts you with the position of <i>general practitioner</i> within its hospital factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome patients, examine them, diagnose, and prescribe with caution. A mistake can happen so quickly…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any questions, complaints, or special requests, please refer to our motto:<br><strong><i>“Health has a price, and everyone must contribute.”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/9f1aecb712dad0feccb60b6d597065b0.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>Every patient is a potential fraudster. You have been warned.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fake name, expired card, invalid insurance? It’s up to you to keep undesirables from accessing healthcare. You are the last line of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Management is watching you…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/010866f20fd242111a7c404a2ffcdb64.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Put away your rudimentary tools: medicine is serious business.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, Management equips you with the finest French medical technology. True diagnostic weapons, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a rechargeable battery-powered flashlight</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a thermometer that goes beep-beep</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>an intra-auricular blood pressure monitor</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a suspicious-odor sniffer</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/fc94eeb0622d1debac4a849c76b65543.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stranger-than-strange diseases…</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visceral sensitivity to light (vomiting included), sudden appearance of a wagging tail, or instant hair regrowth… Here, every symptom is a surprise, every diagnosis a gamble, and every mistake leaves a mark—on your paycheck as well as in tomorrow’s news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/0a6e43866db3ce7f4b0b652f6f4748fe.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1560 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/2529bef0619bfaa40ec0204edccca217.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Schemes, lies, bribes, and retaliation.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, being a doctor is not limited to treating patients. Every decision matters. Some choices make survival easier. Others bring it to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this world, a single mistake can cost more than your reputation.</i></p>", "short_description": "Awaken the incompetent doctor within you! Diagnose strange patients, examine their absurd symptoms… and prescribe treatments that could change their lives… or cut them short. Your actions will have consequences.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/1b3466587e5e775c6cd7bde6d5d44a046c3b2204/header.jpg?t=1770999607", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/075c9ad99065bb84eeb49836e33e69eaf7d33b1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770999607", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/075c9ad99065bb84eeb49836e33e69eaf7d33b1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770999607", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires 